                  "blocks": {
                    "text_ehLfyP": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p><strong>Quality Materials</strong><br/>Our jewelry is handcrafted using quality materials, including stainless steel with 14K white gold or 18K yellow gold finishes, depending on the piece. See Product Details for exact specifications.<br/><br/><strong>Made to Last</strong><br/>Our jewelry is designed for lasting beauty with normal wear. To keep your piece looking its best, avoid prolonged exposure to water, chemicals, lotions, and perfumes, and store it safely when not in use.<br/><br/><strong>Handcrafted in the USA</strong><br/>Unless otherwise noted, our jewelry is lovingly created, packaged, and shipped from our production facility in St. Petersburg, Florida.<br/><br/><strong>Made With Meaning ❤️</strong><br/>Every piece is created to be more than a beautiful gift—it’s a lasting reminder of the love behind it.</p>",
